acs="#m-e8df1e18-e623-4c8e-ae36-8c36c9360a38" label="lyrics-like">laetántes. Per eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-dac6d9a2-78c8-4254-84cb-99cce881dc09" facs="#m-e700f45c-473e-4778-a971-8fdc2411330b" label="lyrics-like">sti:t ipsius pia intercessióne da</l><l xml:id="m-9a27b6f7-6818-48b6-a71d-acb4dfe9ad96" facs="#m-03ac798c-274e-470e-9936-53074312972d" label="lyrics-like">Epistle. Víduas honóra. p. 1462.</l><l xml:id="m-795790af-163d-44c8-a850-ad113a44a5ef" facs="#m-b67032d2-83c1-41fc-87db-458b20157d19" label="ambiguous">St. John Leonardi Confessor.</l><l xml:id="m-271859a6-02e6-4bbf-bb74-4b1af3609026" facs="#m-2450836f-6972-4570-aaec-db844e99c4b5" label="ambiguous">9.</l><l xml:id="m-9063cfbb-77c5-4064-aebd-9d4fe85e85fe" facs="#m-033002a4-fbb9-4af5-ba76-82d557c3afbe" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-3ecad1eb-06fa-45fd-9834-27ba1591d05a" facs="#m-be427b4c-6d3d-4deb-b8c0-799c7241e5ce" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-8875cc76-10c2-45e8-b1d1-dd6353365afe" facs="#m-7a76d0fd-db3d-432a-b813-e4bbeb1946c1" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-5b84e411-cc32-43ca-9b1e-3ebf20196b4c" facs="#m-14e03293-e8fd-4146-b491-ef8c9baef6d9" label="lyrics-like">Nser-mó¬ nibus “Dó-mi-ni</l><l xml:id="m-9f735d5c-5b1b-4bda-857f-bfdda0262cde" facs="#m-169e3c5f-9b70-443f-a601-71f40e4448a4" label="lyrics-like">ó-pe-ra</l><l xml:id="m-77f1abb2-4b60-485e-97b6-9b116ccb0634" facs="#m-88ea5a6e-4f7e-457b-ad40-97c55ceff4b0" label="lyrics-like">é- jus: sol il-lú-mi-nans per ómni-a respé-xit, et gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-5c33936d-1fe5-4b85-a0c5-003c19e12466" facs="#m-fc7b4ddc-08d6-44a4-a7f8-438fe45471e0" label="lyrics-like">ri- a Dó- mi-ni plé-num est ó-pus é¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d0b24c6-84ba-4063-a241-cb82b23bbe07" facs="#m-7014196c-77e7-4acb-a914-46c1add114d3" label="ambiguous">ius.</l><l xml:id="m-b8476aa4-0630-4cb1-a907-99c8422a284e" facs="#m-bca739f7-135b-4ff8-95d6-a395fdc8cc1b" label="lyrics-like">PT. Alle-lú¬ ia</l><l xml:id="m-1fe9d99f-c934-4e83-a05c-df6104679b82" facs="#m-4a25c182-d227-4312-a655-ffd3ddc94446" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú- ia. Ps. Cantá-te Dómino</l><l xml:id="m-45166245-8a4d-4a6a-b2f5-59f55824a027" facs="#m-eae4b0f9-f099-4a21-81c9-f2d141651100" label="lyrics-like">cánticum nóvum: * cantá-te Dómino ómnis térra. Gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-5005e2d4-d537-4eb1-987d-6af27deca365" facs="#m-0abcb802-6754-4ad2-b84e-1a152189332e" label="lyrics-like">ri- a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-d926b5a8-318d-4c4e-8a41-e682af74ba37" facs="#m-92e96ebc-e9fa-4c27-a6aa-2b7a8d4037fb" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-7d7e48d7-886b-4f78-bc52-75b08ccae4a5" facs="#m-1071cd85-8b8a-4411-91cd-9de769796504" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui beátum Joánnem Con-l excitáre dignátus es, ac per eum</l><l xml:id="m-a812e9ee-745d-4869-b1f6-cbeb7bf30ff3" facs="#m-9dd295db-3b91-4d4c-aa12-443dcb130ca2" label="lyrics-like">D fessórem tuum, ad fidem in</l><l xml:id="m-855a1b20-c732-438f-b889-4f912cbf3f4f" facs="#m-2c4ffa02-e93d-4f25-92f9-0bdbb9891e11" label="lyrics-like">in erudiéndis fidélibus novam in</l><l xml:id="m-4dd93aaa-bba0-4f34-93fe-502503568dfa" facs="#m-971c6857-a179-4039-983a-54c263ce0a4d" label="lyrics-like">géntibus propagándam mirabiliter! Ecclésia tua familiam congregá¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
